    T59
        title       The suite reads and imports nothing outside the package
        status      draft
        priority    high
        blocked_by  [@T47]
        description
            The conformance suite and the runner read no file, CLI or folder outside `packages/flow-state-v3/` and
            import nothing from `src/` beyond the seam; the data they read from the wiki today is recreated in the
            package as typed code.

            **Held:** runs only when the user says so, or once the project is built out (the user, 2026-11-14); it is
            in no slice order.

            **Why now:** the user, 2026-11-14: the package is self-contained (AGENTS.md, Code style). The suite's
            gates parse dated proposals by matching their prose, so a reworded proposal silently feeds them wrong text.
            Blocked by @T47, whose open files hold most of these reads.

            **Read first:** code:wiki/plans/flow/references/proposals/self-contained-audit-2026-11-14.md
            (groups A, E, F), code:packages/flow-state-v3/conformance/parts/records.ts,
            code:packages/flow-state-v3/conformance/runner/specs.ts.

            **Approach:** the feature rows, pair rules, slices and Spec Invariant lists become typed modules in the
            package. The check that a Task owner is still open is a fact about the wiki: it moves to
            `tools/plan-coverage`, beside `check:plans` (orchestrator, 2026-11-14). The gates file takes its revision
            from a runner argument, or records it as missing, visibly. Mutant copies resolve dependencies through the
            package's own declared ones. Concepts and comment citations (audit groups B, C, D, G) are not in scope:
            they are deferred to revisit.md (the user, 2026-11-14); round-14's prototype adapters stay as they are.

            False pass: a recreated table that drifts from the wiki → caught by the `tools/` check comparing them.
            Gates: every suite gate as before, green at the same counts; a planted outside read (a `wiki/` path, a
            `wk` call, `../../..` past the root) fails the new check.
            User's read: where each moved check now lives.
        acceptance
            - no `node:fs` read, child process or symlink in `conformance/` or `bench/` reaches outside the package,
              shown by a test that walks the source and plants one of each;
            - `conformance/` imports from `src/` only `src/index.ts` and the listed seam (audit group E);
            - `packages/flow-state-v3/package.json` declares the dependencies the package imports (audit group F);
            - every gate in `conformance/gates.json` keeps its verdict and counts at the Task's first and last
              revisions;
            - the wiki-facing checks (open owners, recreated tables against their source) run from `tools/` and fail
              on a planted mismatch.
        comment     2026-11-14T03:26:15Z
